Builds the game crate

Usage: leptoskit game build [OPTIONS] [PATH]

Arguments:
  [PATH]  The game directory. Defaults to `game/lantern` when that crate is here, otherwise the current directory

Options:
      --release  Build in release mode
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
